      <title>Rivian 2.5亿美元和解金：R1定价风波未平，R2豪赌能否翻盘？</title>
      <link>https://johhhhnny.github.io/TeslaDaily/posts/2da91a90efebaa5efba407d32ae83684_ai/</link>
